OL,3,GNEWSA'No reports' made to Stormont's
OL,4,ADonaldson review
OL,5,
OL,6,FA review by the Northern Ireland
OL,7,FAssembly into Jeffrey Donaldson's
OL,8,Fconduct during his time at Stormont has
OL,9,Ffound "no relevant information"
OL,10,Frequiring further investigation.
OL,12,FNo reports were received as part of the
OL,13,Fexercise, which was commissioned in
OL,14,FJuly following the former Democratic
OL,15,FUnionist Party (DUP) leader's
OL,16,Fconviction for child sex offences.
OL,18,FDonaldson was convicted in June of 18
OL,19,Fcounts of sex abuse including one count
OL,20,Fof rape, which he committed against two
OL,21,Fwomen when they were children.
OL,22,FDonaldson is to appeal.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,417,410,260,120,0,100
